{
  "name": "Touch of the Long Death (Way of the Long Death)",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your touch can channel the energy of death into a creature. As an Action, you touch one creature within 5 feet of you, and you expend 1 to 10 ki points. The target must make a Constitution Saving Throw, and it takes 2d10 necrotic damage per ki point spent on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one. A creature that failed this Saving Throw has to repeat the Saving Throw at the end of each of its turn. On a failure, it takes necrotic damage equal to your monk level. Until it succeeds, the creature cannot benefit from healing.</p>",
